      "description": "Watch Dinamo Tirana vs Pafos highlights and goals from UEFA Europa Conference League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 20, 2026. The stage was set for a tense UEFA Conference League clash on 20 August 2026, as Dinamo Tirana and Pafos FC looked to assert their authority in a battle that required total concentration from the opening whistle. Both teams approached the match with clear intent, knowing that every possession could prove vital. First-half tension and missed opportunities The opening period was defined by tactical discipline and physical challenges, leading to a flurry of yellow cards. The most significant moment of the first half arrived in the 38th minute when Dinamo Tirana was awarded a penalty. David Luiz stepped up to take the spot-kick, but he failed to convert, leaving the game locked in a deadlock heading into the break. Second-half shift and clinical finish The pace increased significantly after the interval, with both managers utilizing their benches to refresh the lineups. The deadlock was finally broken in the 78th minute when David Fadairo found the back of the net, clinicaly finishing an assist provided by Adamu Alhassan . Just minutes later, in the 83rd minute, Lele effectively sealed the victory for Pafos FC by coolly converting a penalty. Late frustration saw the hosts collect several bookings, including cards for Aldo Teqja , Bruno Dita , and Lorenco Vila , but the visitors held firm to see out the result until the referee signaled the end of the match."
